くらい冷やしてから切ると涙の原因物質が出にくくて目が痛くなりにくいです〜 \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E_PG9S6UUAEAAGZ.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"全農広報部【公式】日本の食を味わう","author_subname":"@zennoh_food","author_link":"https://twitter.com/zennoh_food/status/1437711466413449217","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1148382558670868480/HDNQM4bI_normal.png","text":".　\n　　　　タ　　\n　　　　マ　　\n　　　　ネ\n　　　　ギ　　\n　　冷　は\n　　や\n　　し\n　　て\n　　切　　　　\n　　る\n涙　と\n知　　　　　　\nら　　　　　　\nず\n\n冷蔵庫で30分くらい冷やしてから切ると涙の原因物質が出にくくて目が痛くなりにくいです〜 \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E_PG9S6UUAEAAGZ.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/E_PG9S6UUAEAAGZ.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1631612099,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/zennoh_food/status/1437711466413449217","original_url":"https://twitter.com/zennoh_food/status/1437711466413449217"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Na1EN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5EE9664B-C581-45C4-A0CA-2F7B1310E0DA","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"ウィンナーコーヒー\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/ninjaryugo/status/1437375524486070274|https://twitter.com/ninjaryugo/status/1437375524486070274\u003e","ts":"1631609321.429800","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/ninjaryugo|@ninjaryugo\u003e: これさ、メニューに写真載ってないんだよ…普通にアイスウインナーコーヒー頼むと何の説明も確認もなくこれが出てくるの反則でしょ。 \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/ext_tw_video_thumb/1437375366583119874/pu/img/_5FndIbY5mMzvLNf.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"竜斗＠時代殺陣連珠10/3長島スパコス","author_subname":"@ninjaryugo","author_link":"https://twitter.com/ninjaryugo/status/1437375524486070274","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1367403251641978881/vGanypg5_normal.jpg","text":"これさ、メニューに写真載ってないんだよ…普通にアイスウインナーコーヒー頼むと何の説明も確認もなくこれが出てくるの反則でしょ。","thumb_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/ext_tw_video_thumb/1437375366583119874/pu/img/_5FndIbY5mMzvLNf.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1631532004,"service_name":"twitter","thumb_width":675,"thumb_height":1200,"video_html":"\u003cvideo controls poster=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/ext_tw_video_thumb/1437375366583119874/pu/img/_5FndIbY5mMzvLNf.jpg\" width=\"675\" height=\"1200\"\u003e\u003csource type=\"video/mp4\" src=\"https://video.twimg.com/ext_tw_video/1437375366583119874/pu/vid/720x1280/ei34bafkA4Ka7atM.mp4?tag=12\"\u003e\u003c/video\u003e","video_html_width":675,"video_html_height":1200,"from_url":"https://twitter.com/ninjaryugo/status/1437375524486070274","original_url":"https://twitter.com/ninjaryugo/status/1437375524486070274"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fuita","count":2,"users":["U06BRP8VD","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"usv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e54204a-482a-49f8-ba15-c1cc3cff0607","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"\u003chttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Okanagan_Valley_(wine_region)\u003e 歴史としてはまだ浅い","ts":"1631600228.429000","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: Okanagan Valley (wine region)","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/","title":"Okanagan Valley (wine region)","title_link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Okanagan_Valley_(wine_region)","text":"The  Okanagan Valley wine region, located within the region of the same name in the British Columbia Interior, is Canada's second-largest wine producing area. Along with the nearby Similkameen Valley, the approximately 8,619 acres (3,488 hectares) of vineyards planted in the Okanagan (2018 data) account for more than 80% of all wine produced in British Columbia, and are second in economic importance for wine production to the Niagara Peninsula of Ontario. Some 182 licensed wineries existed from south to north in the valley in 2018, with many situated along the 135 km (84 mi)-long Okanagan Lake and its tributaries and downstream lakes, including Skaha Lake, Vaseux Lake, and Osoyoos Lake. The Okanagan has diverse terrain that features many different microclimates and vineyard soil types, contributing characteristics which are part of an Okanagan terroir.Wine production in the Okanagan dates to the 1850s, with the establishment of Okanagan Mission and the planting of grapevines to supply sacramental wines. In the early 20th century, prohibition in Canada wiped out many of the Okanagan's earliest wineries and the commercial wine industry in the area was not revived until the 1930s. From this time through the mid-1970s, the Okanagan wine industry was based entirely on the production of fruit wines and those produced from hybrid grapes. The Okanagan wine industry has been developed to include dining experiences for pairing wine with farm-to-plate foods.","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e9/Vineyards_of_Covert_Farms_02.jpg/1200px-Vineyards_of_Covert_Farms_02.jpg","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Okanagan_Valley_(wine_region)","original_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Okanagan_Valley_(wine_region)"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"scd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20d59e4f-f018-4975-990f-93ae07f4e8d9","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"(Kelowna International Airportから車で0h13min)","ts":"1631600130.428700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DANb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c0d9abb-3eef-47c4-8640-b9d7c15936db","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"(:memo: Gray MonkはKelownaとVernonの間。Vancouverから車で4h36m)","ts":"1631600097.428300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vgg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7aff45d2-a420-4fd2-b39e-bf1c9f